#1: Test recording of DIAG entries for PASS or FAIL responses within a test
Suggest you hit FAIL the first time round and PASS the next time to demonstrate the clearing of a result.
DIAG: This is a line for diagnostics file
PASS_FAIL:

#1.2: Test recording of FP DIAG numbers
Suggest you hit FAIL the first and second time round, then finally remove error by hitting PASS.
DIAG: This is a line for diagnostics file
PASS_FAIL:

#2: Test JPG image within DIAG
Hit FAIL the first time round.
DIAG: DISPLAY: T1.JPG
DIAG: T1.JPG is displayed below
PASS_FAIL:

#3: Test TXT file displayed by DIAG command
Hit FAIL the first time round.
DIAG: DISPLAY: DIAG_TEXT.txt
DIAG: DIAG_TEXT.txt is displayed above
PASS_FAIL:

#4: Test CLEAR within DIAG
Hit FAIL the first time round.
DIAG: DISPLAY: T1.JPG
DIAG: CLEAR:
DIAG: Picture should not appear below
PASS_FAIL:

#QUIT:
Done - thank you for trying.
SAVE_LOG:

